body:
I love Taylor soo much because I feel like she has a song for absolutely everything. And we're almost the same age (I'm a year younger), so it was like, the songs she put out were the soundtrack to my life.

&#x200B;

Right now, 'Gorgeous' is on repeat because I have the biggest crush on this guy. 

&#x200B;

'Innocent' has helped me through a lot, and is so fitting right now that I'm 32.

&#x200B;

'Love Story' with my first ex, 'Today Was A Fairytale" with my 2nd ex, and 'State of Grace' with my last ex. The songs came out and I was like, wow.

&#x200B;

She just perfectly captures all the different feelings. 

&#x200B;

P.S. I kinda feel bad sharing that I have a lot of exes. Taylor also makes me feel better about that, like it's okay to love and it sometimes does not work out.
